    <title>劫后余生的房车露营：互相支持才是感情的灵魂</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6825a07f5ccf03732bff475d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6825a07f5ccf03732bff475d</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 16 May 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fqqrqkbv-ygZm5xErwvonUnltAty.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>【本期介绍】</span></p><span></span><p><span>🚐 </span><strong><span>房车惊魂24小时：一场价值1万块的“极限求生”</span></strong><br><span>“差10厘米就翻进河里！”“车顶撞出大洞还笑得出来？”我们刚经历完一场价值万元的房车旅行，连夜录下这期“劫后余生”特辑！</span></p><span></span><p><span>原本计划的京郊房车露营：带墨镜看书、溪边烧烤、星空下躺平……现实却是——误入逼仄小路，难关重重，3米宽房车卡在3.05米窄道上，右侧是湍急河流，左侧是刮车的树丛，头顶撞出窟窿，进退两难。</span></p><span></span><p><span>💡 </span><strong><span>为什么听这期？</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>避坑指南：房车修理费花样繁多，价格不菲</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>全程复盘：我们如何过五关斩六斩，成功逃出生天</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>情感分享：伴侣在绝境中如何成为“命运共同体”</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>“我们面对上限60分的答卷，交出了100分的答案”</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>【时间线】</span></p><span></span><p><span>⏱️ </span><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="270">04:30</a> 选目的地：百里画廊诱惑了我们</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>“刷小红书种草‘溪边露营’，结果导航全是‘野生景点’”</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>北京周边目的地选无可选，要想人少只能土坡配浑水...”</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>⏱️ </span><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="675">11:15</a> 致命拐弯：3米房车挤进3.05米窄道</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>“左边刮树右边悬空，轮子离河岸只剩3厘米”</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>“铁丝网划车声像指甲抠黑板，全程肾上腺素飙升”</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>⏱️ </span><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1120">18:40</a> 车顶破洞：价值万元的“咚”</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>“签合同时说‘别把车顶撞穿就行’，结果真穿了个洞”</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>“1万块买断惊悚片体验，能吹一辈子，你说值不值”</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>⏱️ </span><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1570">26:10</a> 深夜困局：脚下有泥潭前后有车堵</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>“太阳下山前必须出去！不能后退、不能掉头，只能前进”</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>⏱️ </span><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2090">34:50</a> 重走来时路，开出“航天级精度”</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>“后视镜和玻璃收放30次，冷静地像机器一般”</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>“一旦放松就又出问题，还好有惊无险”</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>⏱️ </span><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2540">42:20</a> 劫后烧烤：棉被战神与灭炭之战</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>“裹棉被烧炭，火星子没见着，牙齿先开始rap”</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>“赔钱事小，我们安全出来比什么都强”</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lt8TEUrRQi7xXWBTqlEl_6TISJVE.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lsMrqzCDZUt2mer86UH9AyQMcpl-.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fi-ptX4PHUKeC4obyzuG-_2kzI3_.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FucWZSycMH34vMGjmhF9oqq6AayY.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lo-79dLjJF9EUNR0NtaRMTabZFvD.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>【剪辑】</span></p><span></span><p><span>📌 Olina老师</span></p><span></span><p><span>【找到我们】</span></p><span></span><p><span>小红书：</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5cdb95cc000000001200cccc?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5cdb95cc000000001200cccc&amp;apptime=1721631303&amp;share_id=c2e7ff03993343688e8efbaeb7f7fb4e" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5cdb95cc000000001200cccc?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5cdb95cc000000001200cccc&amp;apptime=1721631303&amp;share_id=c2e7ff03993343688e8efbaeb7f7fb4e"><span>momoko是一一</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/60929e6300000000010048b8?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5cdb95cc000000001200cccc&amp;apptime=1721503109&amp;share_id=bde7fd19b32244fe95229c539321df24" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/60929e6300000000010048b8?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5cdb95cc000000001200cccc&amp;apptime=1721503109&amp;share_id=bde7fd19b32244fe95229c539321df24"><s